list.description:
1. Learn the settlement process and take in charge of 1-3 channels’ rebate settlement, such as calculate and check the funds generated monthly, check the promotion settlement data from channel, summarize the actual settlement data by category and product;
2. Analyze and review the spendings by channel and product series;
3. Support to organize meeting and other tasks leader assigned;

list.requirement:
1. Excellent graduates in finance/accounting/business major;
2. Fast learning and strong ability to work with sales and client;
3. Fluent in English or Chinese, Chinese is a plus;
4. Strong excel and data analysis skill is a plus.
